{"unit_id":"lhmd__dsh-promotion-toolkit#feature-1","repo":"lhmd/dsh-promotion-toolkit","commit":"c4e19742d4399e0282ab70829e412fb47bbb42a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Promotion Toolkit 的功能「跨平台宣发矩阵」：将输入的素材生成适配多种社交平台的草稿。调用 viral_kit 并提供文本后，会返回各平台对应文案，也可用 platform 选择主要发布渠道。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:19-28","src/index.js:96-105"]}
